            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.80</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>CRAFTR prompt editor now runs on GPT-5.6 Sol.</b> Smart edits and rewrites in the prompt editor use OpenAI's flagship model instead of the routine tier, for noticeably better prompt quality. Each edit is billed by its actual tokens at the GPT-5.6 Sol rate; the image analysis buttons keep the routine tier.</li>
<li><b>FLUX Video Edit.</b> Drop a clip of up to 15 seconds, describe the change and get it back edited: remove, add or replace objects, change the setting, restyle, change on-screen text or dialogue. Length, framing, camera and audio follow the source. Priced per second of the source clip, 41 credits per second.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
